<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Jamshed Ali — Data Analytics Portfolio</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,500;6..72,600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f5f7fa;--surface:#fff;--ink:#0f2238;--mute:#52627a;--line:#d5dce6;--accent:#1d5fd1;--accent2:#e8effc;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#0b1624;--surface:#12233a;--ink:#e8eef7;--mute:#9fb0c7;--line:#24374f;--accent:#6fa3ff;--accent2:#16304f}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0b1624;--surface:#12233a;--ink:#e8eef7;--mute:#9fb0c7;--line:#24374f;--accent:#6fa3ff;--accent2:#16304f}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);scroll-behavior:smooth}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 16px/1.65 'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif}
a{color:var(--accent)}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
nav{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 88%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);z-index:5}
nav .wrap{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;height:54px;overflow-x:auto;white-space:nowrap}
nav b{font:600 18px 'Newsreader',serif;margin-right:auto}
nav a{color:var(--mute);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:500}nav a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.hero{padding:72px 0 56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:48px;align-items:center}
.photo{width:210px;height:210px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:4px solid var(--surface);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--accent);display:block}
h1{font:600 clamp(40px,7vw,68px)/1.04 'Newsreader',serif;margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.role{font-size:19px;color:var(--mute);max-width:34em;margin:0 0 26px}
.btns{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{padding:11px 20px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.btn.p{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .btn.p{color:#0b1624}}
.facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:8px}
.facts div{padding:20px 24px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.facts div:last-child{border:0}
.facts strong{display:block;font:600 34px 'Newsreader',serif;line-height:1.1}
.facts span{color:var(--mute);font-size:14px}
section{padding:64px 0 0}
h2{font:600 32px 'Newsreader',serif;margin:0 0 24px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink)}
.about{max-width:42em;font-size:18px}
.skills{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px}
.skills h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--mute);font-weight:600}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.chips span{background:var(--accent2);color:var(--ink);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:99px;font-size:14px}
.proj{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:28px;padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.proj:first-of-type{padding-top:0}
.proj h3{font:600 22px/1.25 'Newsreader',serif;margin:0}
.proj small{color:var(--mute)}
.proj ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px}.proj li{margin-bottom:6px}
.tags{margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.tags span{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mute)}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:28px;margin-bottom:26px}
.row h3{margin:0;font-size:17px}.row time{color:var(--mute);font-size:14px}
.row ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:20px}
.contact{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 36px;font-size:18px}
.cert{margin:22px 0 0;max-width:560px}.cert img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:#fff}.cert figcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:8px;word-break:break-all}
footer{margin:72px 0 0;padding:28px 0 40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--mute);font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:700px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:left;padding-top:40px}.photo{order:-1;width:170px;height:170px}.proj,.row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.facts div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style></head><body>
<nav><div class="wrap"><b>Jamshed Ali</b><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#skills">Skills</a><a href="#projects">Projects</a><a href="#experience">Experience</a><a href="#education">Education</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div></nav>
<main class="wrap">
<header class="hero">
<div>
<h1>Jamshed Ali</h1>
<p class="role">Data Analytics undergraduate at IIT Patna. I turn raw data into clear, decision-ready insight with Python, SQL and Power BI.</p>
<div class="btns"><a class="btn p" href="#projects">View projects</a><a class="btn" href="mailto:jamshedalimd205@gmail.com">Get in touch</a></div>
</div>
<img class="photo" alt="Portrait of Jamshed Ali" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,">
</header>
<div class="facts">
<div><strong>9.73 / 10</strong><span>CPI, B.Sc. CS &amp; Data Analytics</span></div>
<div><strong>3</strong><span>End-to-end analytics projects</span></div>
<div><strong>IIT Patna</strong><span>Class of 2029</span></div>
</div>

<section id="about"><h2>About</h2>
<p class="about">I am a Data Analytics student at IIT Patna with strong statistical fundamentals and a habit of finishing the story: clean the data, find the pattern, then present it so a non-technical stakeholder can act on it. I have built projects across sales performance, customer churn and computer vision, and completed Deloitte's Data Analytics Job Simulation (April 2026). I am looking for Data Analyst and Data Science roles.</p>
<p class="about">At IIT Patna I also serve as Assistant Head Coordinator at the Training &amp; Placement Cell.</p>
</section>

<section id="skills"><h2>Skills</h2>
<div class="skills">
<div><h3>Languages and querying</h3><div class="chips"><span>Python</span><span>SQL</span><span>C++</span></div></div>
<div><h3>Data and BI tools</h3><div class="chips"><span>Power BI</span><span>Tableau</span><span>Excel (pivot tables, advanced formulas)</span></div></div>
<div><h3>Libraries</h3><div class="chips"><span>Pandas</span><span>NumPy</span><span>Matplotlib</span><span>Seaborn</span><span>scikit-learn</span></div></div>
<div><h3>Core competencies</h3><div class="chips"><span>Exploratory data analysis</span><span>Statistical analysis</span><span>Data cleaning</span><span>Data storytelling</span><span>ML fundamentals</span></div></div>
</div></section>

<section id="projects"><h2>Projects</h2>
<article class="proj"><div><h3>Sales Data Analysis Dashboard</h3><small>Personal project</small></div>
<div><ul><li>Cleaned and transformed a sales dataset with Python and Pandas to find the top-performing regions and products and the trend over time.</li><li>Designed an interactive Power BI dashboard with KPI visuals so performance questions can be answered in seconds instead of manual reporting.</li></ul>
<div class="tags"><span>Python</span><span>Pandas</span><span>Power BI</span></div></div></article>
<article class="proj"><div><h3>Customer Churn Analysis</h3><small>Personal project</small></div>
<div><ul><li>Investigated customer records in Python to isolate the main drivers of churn.</li><li>Turned the findings into a visual retention brief with a concrete recommendation to reduce at-risk churn.</li></ul>
<div class="tags"><span>Python</span><span>Pandas</span><span>Seaborn</span></div></div></article>
<article class="proj"><div><h3>Face Detection Attendance System</h3><small>Personal project</small></div>
<div><ul><li>Built a real-time face-detection attendance system in Python and OpenCV.</li><li>Removed manual roll-call and proxy attendance by logging presence automatically.</li></ul>
<div class="tags"><span>Python</span><span>OpenCV</span><span>Computer vision</span></div></div></article>
</section>

<section id="experience"><h2>Experience</h2>
<div class="row"><div><h3>Deloitte Data Analytics Job Simulation</h3><time>Forage · April 2026</time></div>
<ul><li>Classified and audited a raw business dataset for quality issues, then modeled it into a stakeholder-ready dashboard.</li><li>Applied Deloitte's forensic-technology workflow to turn ambiguous business questions into a structured, data-backed recommendation.</li></ul><figure class="cert"><img alt="Deloitte Data Analytics Job Simulation certificate of completion, April 21st, 2026" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"><figcaption>Certificate of Completion, April 21, 2026. Enrolment verification code K8Pwh38uPcN62wBtM. User verification code 69e7884bee4737e672a2f805. Issued by Forage.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="row"><div><h3>Assistant Head Coordinator</h3><time>Training &amp; Placement Cell, IIT Patna</time></div><div></div></div>
</section>

<section id="education"><h2>Education</h2>
<div class="row"><div><h3>B.Sc. Computer Science &amp; Data Analytics</h3><time>2025 – 2029</time></div>
